<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18390" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">flōrĕus</span></b> , a, um,
			adj.
		flos, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>of flowers</i>, <i>made of flowers</i> (<b>poet.</b>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">corona,</span>”
				<i>a wreath of flowers</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Men. 4, 2, 68</span></i>
			.— <i>Plur.</i>, <i><span class="en">Plaut. Aul.
				2, 8, 15</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">serta,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tib.
					1, 1, 12</span></i>
			 (22 M.); 1, 2, 14.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>Full of flowers</i>, <i>flowery</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rura,</span>”
				<i>flowery meads</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 1, 430</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">juga Hymetti,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Val.
					Fl. 5, 344</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, <i>shining</i>, <i>beautiful</i>: crines, Pac. and Att. ap.
					<i><span class="en">Serv. Verg. A. 12, 605</span></i>:
			lanugo, Att. ib. (al. flora).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
